# Deploy-time env file for `mastra deploy --env production`.
#
# It is intentionally empty of variables. `mastra deploy` prefers
# `.env.<environment>` over `.env`, and `.env` holds local-development values
# (notably a localhost DATABASE_URL). Any variable listed here is pushed to the
# platform environment and overwrites the stored value.
#
# Production values live in the Mastra Platform environment record. Set them
# with `mastra env set` (or the dashboard), never from a local `.env`.
